Strut Your Stuff - unofficial Fabric / Create Fly port for Minecraft 26.2.

Upstream: https://github.com/cakeGit/StrutYourStuff (Cake)
Upstream distribution: https://modrinth.com/mod/strut-your-stuff
This distribution: a modification by chaevsfe, ported from upstream commit 8c6ad01
(mod_version 1.3.1, NeoForge / Minecraft 1.21.1) to Fabric / Create Fly on Minecraft 26.2.
Port repository: https://github.com/chaevsfe/StrutYourStuff

Licence grant

The upstream repository contains no LICENCE file and no copyright line. Every
distributed upstream artefact declares MIT: src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml
line 3 is license = "MIT", and the Modrinth project field is "MIT License (MIT)".
This port therefore relies on that declared MIT grant. Because upstream wrote no
notice for this port to preserve, the accompanying LICENSE file is the standard MIT
text with a copyright line constructed for this distribution naming the upstream
author (Cake / cakeGit, first commit 2026-03-02). It is not a notice taken from
upstream, and it does not enlarge or restrict the grant upstream declared.

Third-party stand-ins written for this port

The classes under com.cake.struts.compat.sable are inert stubs written for this port.
They reproduce only the method signatures Strut Your Stuff calls and contain no code
from Sable Companion (dev.ryanhcode.sable); the real mod is declared incompatible in
fabric.mod.json.
